# Koleksi REST — Webhook OpenWA
#
# Endpoint ini dipanggil OpenWA, bukan klien mobile. Koleksi ini mensimulasikan kiriman OpenWA
# untuk memeriksa lapisan keamanan dan idempotency.
#
# PERINGATAN: bentuk body webhook OpenWA v4 BELUM direkam dari instance nyata (spike P0).
# Body di bawah hanya tiruan kasar untuk menguji jalur 204/401/idempotency; ganti dengan
# rekaman asli dari spike/recordings/ begitu tersedia.
#
# @webhookSecret harus sama dengan WEBHOOK_SECRET di .env. @webhookPath adalah segmen acak
# di URL yang didaftarkan ke OpenWA (opsi -w).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@webhookSecret = ganti-dengan-rahasia-acak-minimal-16-karakter
@webhookPath = a7f2k9m3q1

### ============================================================
### POST /webhooks/openwa/:path
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 204 (diterima dan disimpan mentah ke message_logs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookPath}}
X-Webhook-Secret: {{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "onMessage",
  "sessionId": "cashify-bot",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_6281234567890@c.us_3EB0A1B2C3D4E5F60789",
    "from": "6281234567890@c.us",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "tadi makan siang 25 ribu",
    "t": 1790000000
  }
}

### Idempotency: kirim ulang body yang SAMA dengan di atas. Harus tetap 204 dan
### message_logs tetap satu baris (unique session_id + wa_message_id), tanpa transaksi ganda.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookPath}}
X-Webhook-Secret: {{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "onMessage",
  "sessionId": "cashify-bot",
  "data": {
    "id": "false_6281234567890@c.us_3EB0A1B2C3D4E5F60789",
    "from": "6281234567890@c.us",
    "fromMe": false,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "tadi makan siang 25 ribu",
    "t": 1790000000
  }
}

### Aturan 6: fromMe true harus diabaikan. Tetap 204, tidak ada job yang masuk antrean.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookPath}}
X-Webhook-Secret: {{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "onMessage",
  "sessionId": "cashify-bot",
  "data": {
    "id": "true_6281234567890@c.us_3EB0FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF",
    "from": "6281234567890@c.us",
    "fromMe": true,
    "type": "chat",
    "body": "Tercatat: makan siang Rp25.000",
    "t": 1790000005
  }
}

### Error 401: rahasia salah
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookPath}}
X-Webhook-Secret: rahasia-yang-salah-sama-sekali
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "onMessage"
}

### Error 401: header rahasia tidak ada
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookPath}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "onMessage"
}

### Error 400: body bukan JSON yang valid (rahasia benar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/openwa/{{webhookPath}}
X-Webhook-Secret: {{webhookSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ ini bukan json
